SQL> -- day-13
SQL> -- 1. Write a PLSQL block to calculate and update the Total for each and every student.
SQL> ed
Wrote file afiedt.buf

  1  begin
  2  	UPDATE student1 set total=(sub1+sub2+sub3);
  3* end;
SQL> /

