SQL> -- 2. Calculate the grade of all students, based to total (>70 AA, >60 A, >50 B, >35 C, else Fail)
SQL> ed
Wrote file afiedt.buf

  1  begin
  2  	update student1 set grade=
  3  	case
  4  		when total>270 then 'AA'
  5  		when total>250 then 'A'
  6  		when total>200 then 'B'
  7  		when total>150 then 'C'
  8  	else 'Fail'
  9  	end;
 10* end;
SQL> /

PL/SQL procedure successfully completed.

